::  Layout rectangle -- position and dimension on a bounded grid.
::  col and row are the origin; width and height are the extent.
::  Skate's cell grid is 40 columns by 8 rows; the gate family
::  validates each field against those ceilings.
+$  layout-rect-shape
  $:  col=@u32
      row=@u32
      width=@u32
      height=@u32
  ==
